                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". If you’re currently using Antora 2, you may need to make the following changes to your documentation system before upgrading to Antora {page-component-version}. If you’re already using Antora 3.0, skip this section and go to "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Upgrade Node.js"
                  }
